    {
      "text": "Its body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "One boy’s invention led to the development of many different machines that take advantage of Rotom’s unique capabilities.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "With a body made of plasma, it can inhabit all sorts of machines. It loves to surprise others.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o'-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
